From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oleksii Kulinich <entaytion@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 01:57:55 +0300
Subject: feat(chat): render developer badges in chat headers, message names, dialogs, search and profiles

- badge entinyGram/inuGram developers and official channels next to names in the chat header, message bubbles, dialog rows, profile search results and profiles
- make name/forwarded-header taps on media messages open the message menu instead of being treated as image taps
- hideable via InuConfig.HIDE_DEV_BADGES (badges shown by default)
